  <title>Now live: TurnB PPT Agent</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f1f3f2;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#000000;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" bgcolor="#F1F3F2" style="background-color:#f1f3f2;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:32px 16px;">
        <table role="presentation" width="640" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="width:100%;max-width:640px;background-color:#ffffff;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;box-shadow:0 3px 16px rgba(30,55,53,0.10);">
          <tr>
            <td bgcolor="#008C85" style="height:6px;background-color:#008c85;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="font-size:0;line-height:0;">
              <img src="cid:turnb-ppt-agent-banner" alt="TurnB PPT Agent" width="640" border="0" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:640px;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;">
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:30px 44px 27px;border-bottom:3px solid #008c85;">
              <div style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;line-height:18px;color:#008c85;">NOW AVAILABLE</div>
              <h1 style="margin:0;font-size:31px;font-weight:bold;line-height:38px;letter-spacing:-0.5px;color:#172a2a;">Meet the TurnB PPT Agent</h1>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:30px 44px 14px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 18px;">Hi Team,</p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 18px;">The <strong>TurnB PPT Agent</strong> is now available. It helps turn rough project and case-study material into a branded, presentation-ready PowerPoint deck through a guided chat experience.</p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 24px;">Use it in your browser or directly in Microsoft Teams, and please share your feedback with the AI Team.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 44px 30px;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" bgcolor="#EEF7F6" style="background-color:#eef7f6;border-left:4px solid #008c85;">
                <tr>
                  <td bgcolor="#EEF7F6" style="padding:21px 24px;background-color:#eef7f6;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#000000;">
                    <strong style="font-size:17px;color:#000000;">Access the agent</strong><br>
                    <span style="display:block;margin-top:8px;"><strong>Web:</strong> Select the button below.</span>
                    <span style="display:block;margin-top:6px;"><strong>Microsoft Teams:</strong> Go to <em>Apps</em> &gt; <em>Added by your org</em>, then select <strong>TurnB PPT Agent</strong>.</span>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 44px 36px;">
              <!--[if mso]>
              <v:roundrect xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" href="https://turnb-ppt-agent.proudfield-52993ca6.eastus2.azurecontainerapps.io/" style="height:46px;v-text-anchor:middle;width:225px;" arcsize="9%" stroke="f" fillcolor="#008C85">
                <w:anchorlock/>
                <center style="color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;">Open TurnB PPT Agent &rarr;</center>
              </v:roundrect>
              <![endif]-->
              <!--[if !mso]><!-->
              <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:separate;">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" bgcolor="#008C85" style="border-radius:4px;background-color:#008c85;">
                    <a href="https://turnb-ppt-agent.proudfield-52993ca6.eastus2.azurecontainerapps.io/" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 22px;border:1px solid #008c85;border-radius:4px;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;line-height:16px;text-decoration:none;">Open TurnB PPT Agent&nbsp;&nbsp;&rarr;</a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
              <!--<![endif]-->
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:25px 44px 10px;border-top:1px solid #d9e0de;">
              <h2 style="margin:0;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;color:#000000;">How to use it</h2>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 44px 32px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;">
              <ol style="margin:9px 0 0;padding-left:22px;">
                <li style="padding-bottom:9px;">Open the agent in the browser or Teams.</li>
                <li style="padding-bottom:9px;">Upload source material or describe the case study in the chat. Word, PDF, PowerPoint, Excel, and text-based files are supported.</li>
                <li style="padding-bottom:9px;">Answer the follow-up questions and review the proposed slide content.</li>
                <li>Generate and download your branded PowerPoint deck.</li>
              </ol>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td bgcolor="#F2F4F4" style="padding:24px 44px 34px;background-color:#f2f4f4;border-top:1px solid #d9e0de;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#000000;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 18px;">This initial release is an early prototype, shared to help us validate the experience with real use cases. Your feedback will directly shape the next iteration. We would especially value your thoughts on the workflow, the quality of the generated decks, the user interface, and any features or changes that would make it more useful for your work.</p>
              <p style="margin:0;color:#000000;">Thank you,<br><strong>AI Team</strong></p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
